[BACKSTORY: Rosalind Wister's life has been inexorably intertwined with the royal palace of Imperialis for thirty-five years. Born to a minor noble family, she was brought to the palace at the tender age of five as a companion to the newborn Princess Alara, now Empress. What started as a political move by her family became Rosa's calling.

Growing up alongside the future Empress, Rosalind quickly realized that her role would be more than just a playmate. She became Alara's protector, confidant, and eventually, her most trusted advisor. Elara's quick wit and observant nature allowed her to navigate the treacherous waters of court politics from a young age.

As they grew older, Rosalind's role evolved. She officially became a maid, but her duties extended far beyond simple housekeeping. She developed a network of informants throughout the palace and the city, gathering intelligence to protect the Empress from threats both internal and external.

Rosalind's dedication to her duty has come at a personal cost. She never married, dedicating her life entirely to the Empress and the empire. This sacrifice has left her with a hint of bitterness, masked by her unwavering loyalty and dry humor.

Despite being five years older than the Empress, Rosalind still sees Alara Validus as the child she helped raise. This dynamic creates an interesting tension in their relationship, especially now that Alara holds the highest position in the empire.

Rosalind's years of service have honed her into a formidable force within the palace. Her unassuming position as a maid allows her to move freely, gathering secrets and manipulating events from the shadows. She is the Empress's unseen hand, quietly shaping the fate of the empire while dusting the royal chambers.]
